      "body": "Analysts have revised their fair value estimate for Gateway Distriparks to ₹96 from ₹109, reflecting updated assumptions on discount rate, revenue growth, profit margins, and future P/E. What's in the News The Board declared a one time special interim dividend of ₹1.25 per equity share at 12.5% as a non recurring payout, linked to Gateway Distriparks reaching a net debt free position for the first time since inception and marking 30 years since acquiring land for its first Nhava Sheva CFS facility (Key Developments).",
